From 23895dac40a066573bd297b4705d3d74bc4ebadc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yaroslav Kostiuk <yaroslav0378@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:53:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Vitrail UI: the library's name in place of the working name
